---
title: "acme receives requests"
---
sequenceDiagram
  box transparent Screen
    participant p0 as You
  end
  box transparent Service
    participant p1 as Application
    participant p2 as Worker
  end
  p1->>p2: Asks for the result
  p2-->>p1: Returns the result
  p2->>p2: Updates its cache
  Note over p2,p1: The result is ready
  par Show the result
    p2-)p0: Shows the result
  and Acknowledge the update
    p0->>p2: Acknowledges, with a timeout
  end
  p0--xp2: The update is lost
  p2-)p0: Sends a fresh copy
